ションを得るためにこれらを使用してください） \nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/12nwmolFsYINV3yAPSN1jdr2o54qGgEqX?usp=drive_link \n\n私のキャラクターの参考資料です。彼は褐色の日焼けした肌のタイ人の男の子です。\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x2e5cOUrKd53S18Q4x9mYzkPFK8ARzfO?usp=drive_link \n\n\nふんどし姿の彼を描いてください。しかし、もし裸も描きたければ、描くことができます（彼は割礼しています）。\n\nありがとうございます。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/19nIf3sc3pgYrAbpLzKzW6hHaY34Lvk2A?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mtansuiii/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7729b683/uploads/origins/a5335d8a-b373-447b-abb7-62149cba9532?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=67342dd837aee4c5e687846edb434008", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7729b683/uploads/origins/a5335d8a-b373-447b-abb7-62149cba9532?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=67342dd837aee4c5e687846edb434008, https://si.imgix.net/7729b683/uploads/origins/a5335d8a-b373-447b-abb7-62149cba9532?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4ebf013e3c257b66d1181bb2a939cca3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7729b683/uploads/origins/a5335d8a-b373-447b-abb7-62149cba9532?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6d836eb9a6288a105a7176530b6cef09 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "Hello! I am a big fan of your art and I'm hoping if I can get art of my bunny boy from you!\n\nI would love if I could have a picture of him in his outfit with his orb and purse, but I'd like to leave up to you however you'd like to draw him! \n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/scl/fo/pf02abh9clmfsbg6azxik/ANhBWJXU2-JEu5bqU6dtrCs?rlkey=txg5jxcz5ws9smqfvjtzcenr6&st=5t2ha27i&dl=0", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mtansuiii/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/eae75be3/uploads/origins/6859ef72-4b50-4c9c-988a-13f16a7a8b23?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=116dc69f0d6667c2145f4c483f05affa", "thu